Revision history for RT-Extension-DebugMemory

0.05 2026-05-28

 - Defer PSGIApp construction to avoid Mason cache creation at module load
 - Increment the counter only once for each request

0.04 2026-02-12

 - Convert from GTop and Plack::Middleware::GTop::ProcMem wrapper to using Proc::ProcessTable
   directly in the module, reducing dependencies.
